        "heading_UV7kV4": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Dunrobin Gin Gifts & Gift Sets",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_xDaF6Q": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>A new way to experience Dunrobin: a collection inspired by the landscape, heritage and stories of the North Highlands.</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Gifting has been at the heart of our newly designed Dunrobin Highland Distillery collection.&nbsp;</p><p>From our 20cl and 70cl bottles, presented in premium gift tubes, to our new gin and chocolate gift sets, each product offers a different way to discover, enjoy and share a taste of Dunrobin.</p><p>Our collection also includes locally handmade chocolates, created in collaboration with Highland Whisky Chocolates in Golspie, bringing together two Highland producers with a shared appreciation for quality and craftsmanship.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Dunrobin Gin 20cl Gift Set</strong></p><p>A little taste of Dunrobin, beautifully presented.</p><p>Our 20cl gift set brings together a bottle of Dunrobin Gin and a box of locally handmade Highland Whisky Chocolates, created using Dunrobin Gin.</p><p>Presented together in our newly designed premium gift packaging, this smaller gift set is an ideal introduction to Dunrobin Gin, or a thoughtful gift inspired by the Scottish Highlands.</p><p><strong>Dunrobin Gin 70cl Gift Set</strong></p><p>A premium Scottish gin gift inspired by the North Highlands.&nbsp;</p><p>Our 70cl gift set pairs a full-sized bottle of Dunrobin Gin with a box of locally handmade Highland Whisky Chocolates, crafted using Dunrobin Gin.</p><p>Both are presented in our distinctive new gift packaging, bringing together the flavours, craftsmanship and heritage of Dunrobin in one beautifully presented collection.</p><p><strong>Dunrobin Gin Highland Whisky Chocolates</strong></p><p>Dunrobin Gin, reimagined in chocolate.</p><p>Created in collaboration with award-winning chocolatiers Highland Whisky Chocolates, these indulgent chocolates are handmade in Golspie, just a mile from Dunrobin Castle along the North Coast 500.</p><p>Made using Dunrobin Gin, each chocolate is carefully crafted by hand, bringing together local expertise and the distinctive flavours of our Highland spirit.&nbsp;</p><p>A little taste of Dunrobin, made with care in the heart of Sutherland.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
