    "collapsible_content_EyNEmg": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "item_4fXJ3D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where is Dunrobin Gin made?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin is made at Dunrobin Highland Distillery, located in the historic Old Dairy building at Dunrobin Farm in Golspie, Sutherland.</p><p>Once home to dairy production, this historic building has begun a new chapter, bringing together generations of local heritage with the craft of Highland gin distilling.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_nqgq6w": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does Dunrobin Gin taste like?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin captures the character of the North Highlands through a distinctive blend of earthy, spiced and piney flavours.</p><p>It offers a smooth sip with spiced-floral richness, lifted by juniper and woodland notes, followed by an earthy, gently spicy finish with a subtle edge of bitterness.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_NiUKRM": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which botanicals are used in Dunrobin Gin?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin is crafted using juniper, coriander seed, angelica root, lemon, clove, rose-scented pelargonium and blackcurrant leaf.</p><p>Our rose-scented pelargonium and blackcurrant leaves are carefully grown and harvested from the gardens of Dunrobin Castle in Sutherland.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_WGViUa": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the alcohol strength of Dunrobin Gin?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin has an alcohol strength of 45% ABV.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_KVrcpD": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What is the best way to serve Dunrobin Gin?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin is a versatile spirit that can be enjoyed in several ways.&nbsp;</p><p>Distillery founders Lizzie and Boban Costin particularly enjoy it neat over ice, or served with a premium tonic water, plenty of ice and a fresh lemon garnish.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_TQPk98": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which tonic water and garnish pair best with Dunrobin Gin?",
            "content": "<p>A premium tonic water complements the earthy, floral and spiced notes of Dunrobin Gin.&nbsp;</p><p>At The Wee Gin Shop at Dunrobin Castle, we serve our gin with Walter Gregor's Tonic, proudly made in Scotland, and a fresh lemon garnish.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_8bUyYW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can Dunrobin Gin be used in cocktails?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely! Dunrobin Gin makes a wonderful base for a range of gin cocktails, from a classic Martini to our own Highland-inspired creations.</p><p>One of our favourites is the Gardener's G&T, a refreshing twist on the classic gin and tonic, with the addition of fresh elderflower cordial and a rosemary garnish.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_JU4MMh": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I buy Dunrobin Gin?",
            "content": "<p>Dunrobin Gin is available to purchase online through the Dunrobin Highland Distillery website, with UK delivery available.</p><p>You can also discover our gin in person at The Wee Gin Shop at Dunrobin Castle, which opens seasonally between spring and autumn.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_AXePRU": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do you offer premium Scottish gin gift sets?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Our Dunrobin Gin gift sets are available in two sizes, each beautifully presented in our premium gift packaging.</p><p>Choose between a 20cl or 70cl bottle of Dunrobin Gin, paired with a box of locally handmade Highland Whisky Chocolates created using Dunrobin Gin.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        },
        "item_qd7FXD": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Dunrobin Gin available in smaller bottles?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! Dunrobin Gin is available in 20cl bottles, presented in our newly designed premium gift tubes.</p><p>Ideal for gifting, sharing or discovering Dunrobin Gin for the first time, our smaller bottles offer a little taste of the North Highlands.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "open": false
          }
        }
      },
